OL,3,GNEWSAItems from Ann Widdecombe's estate
OL,4,Aup for auction                         
OL,6,FA number of items, which belonged to   
OL,7,Fthe 78-year-old former Conservative    
OL,8,Fminister turned Reform UK spokeswoman, 
OL,9,Fare due to be auctioned off as part of 
OL,10,Fthe three-day event at Whittons        
OL,11,FAuctions in Honiton, Devon, from 2     
OL,12,FDecember. They include items from her  
OL,13,Ftime in government and her television  
OL,14,Fcareer.                                
OL,16,FMaria Whitton, director of Whittons    
OL,17,FAuctions, said it was a "privilege" to 
OL,18,Fbe entrusted with the estate, adding it
OL,19,Fhas received interest from "around the 
OL,20,Fworld".                                
